{"title":"1995 OIM Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Pieces are placed on a board with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc5c773a00becebf2fe78e775d5953e138efea9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\times n$\" width=\"48\" height=\"9\" /> squares. Each piece placed on the board \"<i>dominates</i>\" all the squares in the row (-), column (|) and diagonal (\\) to which it belongs <b>(*)</b>. Find the smallest number of pieces that must be placed so that all the squares on the board are \"<i>dominated</i>.\"\n</p><p><b>Note (*):</b> Note that the piece does not \"dominate\" the diagonal (/).\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe10.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe10.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017172419\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 21/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 151/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.901      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.901      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26098:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017172419 and revision id 207074. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}